verify.body:
Verify your email to finish creating your STATIX account:
{url}

The link works once, for 24 hours. If you didn't ask for it, ignore this email.

reset.body:
Set a new password:
{url}

The link works once, for 1 hour. If you didn't ask for it, ignore this email.

exists.body:
Someone tried to create an account with this address, but you already have one. Log in here:
{url}

If it wasn't you, you don't need to do anything.

waitlistConfirm.body:
Confirm your email to join the {drop} waitlist:
{url}

The link works for {days} days. If you didn't ask for it, ignore this email and nothing happens.
